# Champion of Dusan ({2}{G}, 4/2 trample): "Renew -- {1}{G}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Put a +1/+1 counter and a
# trample counter on target creature. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot2 Bolts two Champions (the second cast on turn 3 with
# Forest, Mox Emerald and Mox Ruby). On turn 5, with Ornithopter on the stack, renew is refused (sorcery timing) with the mana to
